<title>UK: Ventspils crude pipeline to restart Friday - shipper.</title>
<headline>Ventspils crude pipeline to restart Friday - shipper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pipeline deliveries of crude from the Latvian Baltic port of Ventspils were expected to resume later on Friday, a reliable shipping source said.</p>
<p>Deliveries were halted on Wednesday because the terminal's reservoir capacity is being enlarged.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
